 Entrega assegurada pela Shopee com garantia', 22.99, 12.99, NULL, 'Home & Living > Tools & Home Improvement > Industrial Adhesives & Tapes', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-820md-mp45pkoebpj9c1', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F942805673%2F56411719580', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
