.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7r98o-ltp8wwm4em9576', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F697113195%2F16020757135', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
